{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":173,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T06:20:26.367367418Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"ab6eb2e6-0890-4a93-8d75-8954a4c84d61","title":"Blocker for REQ-8 of sign: needs real-corpus/upstream cross-validation of re-signed HeaderFile output. sign_entry reverses the on-disk signature bytes (sign.rs:174-175, per firmware-layout §7.1 PubkeyFile convention) and target verify (body.rs:393) reverses to match — internally self-consistent (synthetic sign->verify roundtrip verify.rs:360). But upstream HeaderFile verifies via a PLAIN non-reversed Signature (cert_tree.py:63 wraps hf.signature as Signature, not ReversedSignature), so a re-signed HeaderFile may not verify under upstream PSPTool. No psptool-ops test re-signs a real corpus entry and checks it verifies under the reference tool.","priority":"high","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMbAlpU3Tb0Qh5CpvA+QMwJ5XKXVlwLT3PZ0HzggxaRmuS406UXbLKOoC0TJiufCzL2MoL8xNJXV184JTeWH5QY="}
