{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":199,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T08:08:02.283568011Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7d3e8bf4-fc86-456e-9ee3-434b2180f648","comment_uuid":"0c135fa5-d3ce-4c4c-a743-c1d37809d324","author":"tLiK","content":"PLAN — data_region unsigned signature_len fix\n\nEdit: crates/psptool-core/src/body.rs, data_region (~195-197). Replace the unconditional `let sig_len = self.signature_len().ok_or(...)?` with upstream's is_signed-gated value:\n\n  let sig_len = if self.is_signed() {\n      self.signature_len().ok_or(UnsupportedSignatureType(signature_type))?\n  } else { 0 };\n\nWHY: upstream header_file.py:77-84 sets signature_len=0x100/0x200 only inside `if self.is_signed:`; the else branch (line 84) sets signature_len=0. header_file.py:100 then computes body = len - header - signature_len. An unsigned HeaderFile reserves ZERO signature bytes, so its data region is the whole post-header region.\n\nCHAIN: header_file.py:77 (if is_signed) -> :84 (else signature_len=0) -> :100 (body length uses signature_len) => data_region must reserve sig bytes only when signed. is_signed() = signed_raw!=0 (entry.rs:218). Scope: data_region only; signature_bytes untouched (not pinned).","created_at":"2026-07-12T08:08:02.278924894Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA5vtYW7T5fY49ZrILkI+zyvV+UnYsY5y75lBNQyVWZDd8wCt9K9HuarvC4wA4sFIHeZTtO4x4B/+qiQILFi2KAQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMGHanWRxg5WpXKZ1kkJYn96Oe8xoJN8RKdUAoFxgtSqWDisF5RFu6HR2yl/hG0VyU+DQGY2URSoAtTiqspSkQ0="}
