{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":210,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T08:46:05.036101159Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"b697b202-9540-459f-894e-a315ee5421c9","title":"Divergence: find_zlib_start (body.rs:486) scans whole plaintext, not plaintext[..zlib_size] as upstream zlib_find_header(output[:zlib_size])","description":"utils.py:218-234 zlib_find_header is called on s=output[:zlib_size] (header_file.py:171 zlib_decompress(output[:self.zlib_size])), so upstream never inspects bytes at or beyond zlib_size. body.rs:287 calls find_zlib_start(plaintext) on the FULL data region, only bounding to zlib_size AFTER locating the magic. A pathological entry with a zlib magic (0x78 ..) at an offset > zlib_size but < 0x500, and no magic within [0,zlib_size), makes the target locate the out-of-bounds magic and raise ZlibSizeOutOfRange, whereas upstream's zlib_find_header(output[:zlib_size]) returns -1 (no magic in the searched region). Low priority: only reachable on a crafted/corrupt entry. Failing pin: crates/psptool-core/tests/divergence_body_bounds.rs::find_zlib_start_ignores_magic_beyond_zlib_size.","priority":"low","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIeW1CE7ctn4BwP5OOc4/NPKW7MqZ8vSp7A/rvHiazBxCsHmfTvYGJN7scFB2LLMzB0f2ePuoA18c8HfffF3jQo="}
