{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":219,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T08:57:35.209494057Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"b697b202-9540-459f-894e-a315ee5421c9","comment_uuid":"dd8bf107-6371-427a-b2dd-e3d9e8d94bfb","author":"tLiK","content":"Plan: body.rs get_decompressed_body currently calls find_zlib_start(plaintext) over the WHOLE data region (bounded only by the 0x500 window) then clamps to zlib_size AFTER locating a magic (body.rs:296-313). Upstream searches ONLY output[:zlib_size] (header_file.py:171 -> zlib_decompress(output[:self.zlib_size]); utils.py:245 zlib_find_header(s) with s==output[:zlib_size], further clamped to s[:0x500]). Minimal fix: bound the search input to plaintext[..min(zlib_size, plaintext.len())] before calling find_zlib_start, so a magic living past zlib_size is never inspected. When no magic exists within [0,zlib_size) the result is ZlibMagicMissing (matching upstream find -> -1), not ZlibSizeOutOfRange. Single edit in get_decompressed_body; find_zlib_start signature unchanged (already takes a slice). Consistent with #82 (zlib_size = absolute end offset).","created_at":"2026-07-12T08:57:35.204847115Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAHwfLOX6JKombC6FhFkrVoMN1ViYf+GQsOWy9cH2rFe32j2zPwj+GxHjW+zy77kZW/jMgjnqmHwCwjOsDXulCBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCSWEvBPy1afbTVpWP/eWXsovGudT5Tsjb2bVGulEUHIYs2PjNU9YP5JBcnOSlanhqE38pAoWqtuhV7Nhuosog8="}
