{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":243,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T09:55:13.173667867Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"99e1710e-053d-417e-802e-e1c86fb8cb62","comment_uuid":"d87ecac1-0fec-4c17-9911-d21d074e8162","author":"tLiK","content":"REQ-4 class-gate imprecision found during audit (fold into #88 envelope work):\n\nextract.rs REQ-4 claims the class gate 'Mirrors upstream type(file) is HeaderFile guards (__main__.py:193,195)'. It does NOT exactly: entry.class.header() returns Some for BOTH Header AND KeyStore, but upstream 'type(file) is HeaderFile' is an EXACT identity check that is FALSE for KeyStoreFile (key_store_file.py:23 'class KeyStoreFile(HeaderFile)' is a subclass).\n\nConsequences the fixer must handle:\n- Multi-file -u/-c (__main__.py:193-196): a COMPRESSED or ENCRYPTED KeyStore falls to the else branch -> get_bytes() (raw) upstream, but target extract_decompressed/extract_decrypted succeed and return the inflated/decrypted body. (For NON-compressed/NON-encrypted KeyStore the target's cmds/extract.rs:162-164 unwrap_or_else(|_| extract_raw) masks it, so it only diverges for compressed/encrypted KeyStore.)\n- Single-file -u (__main__.py:172): upstream calls file.get_signed_bytes(); for a KeyStore this is KeyStoreFile.get_signed_bytes() = header.get_bytes() ++ key_store.get_bytes() (key_store_file.py:50) -- DIFFERENT from HeaderFile.get_signed_bytes() (header_file.py:162-164). The #88 fix must special-case the KeyStore subtype, not reuse the HeaderFile envelope.\n\nNot separately pinned (entangled with the #88 envelope + needs a compressed/encrypted KeyStore fixture + CLI multi-file path outside the extract.rs unit route); recorded here so the envelope fix covers the KeyStore subtype.","created_at":"2026-07-12T09:55:13.168997207Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAItcWpfiBx8TGpTgJrE4vUZVtPngkAKzL1n4vjafFzwKY8wTq9++nmrH3bFqoI5SfbmiXl5q/5vEhJwBw+LZjAQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGqiVWhaxO1KW1fUXhn48mydc0AwTr/kRhNUEU1NyxLipa7ZtajLsm+D31C6RkNw+DR3hgRUkElkf9Jw9IIjJgk="}
{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":244,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T10:01:07.092701626Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"99e1710e-053d-417e-802e-e1c86fb8cb62","comment_uuid":"208bf085-6c2d-4444-a86e-4ea3dbb2e4aa","author":"tLiK","content":"Plan (fixer): compose EXISTING core helpers in crates/psptool-ops/src/extract.rs only.\n\nextract_decompressed (-u, upstream __main__.py:172 -> get_signed_bytes header_file.py:162-164): replace the data_region+get_decompressed_body body (extract.rs:59-60) with header.get_signed_bytes(entry.body.as_bytes(), Some(Ikek::ZenPlus))? -> header(0x100) ++ decrypted-decompressed[..0x100+size_signed]. Signature unchanged.\n\nextract_decrypted (-c single, __main__.py:176 -> to_decrypted_file_bytes header_file.py:176-182): assemble inline: decrypted = get_decrypted_body(body,ikek)?; sig = signature_bytes(body)? (validate len first so header slice cannot panic, R-CODE-2); out = body[..0x100].to_vec(); out[0x18..0x1C].fill(0); out[0x20..0x30].fill(0); ++ decrypted ++ sig. signature_bytes returns empty for unsigned post-#83, so the 'if is_signed' is free.\n\n#80 (same file): build_encrypted_header_body helper size_signed HEADER_FILE_LEN+plaintext.len() -> plaintext.len() (header-EXCLUSIVE, #79 convention). Import psptool_core::entry::HEADER_FILE_LEN into production scope.","created_at":"2026-07-12T10:01:07.088054631Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAIKQblxqktaMoG4yBsSYl49+oDDjCEHcNI9BlXiCUT2MX4yeIDAz+y5KpIRKifUo3vy6Nc0QHn+KFYOpd0lD9Bg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK2tSIaB1/JKgmjedjPANamL5TT5AysuLro1p8/wYaWpZYCH1M