{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":250,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T10:36:23.156491710Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"0b2e6ea5-c7c5-43f0-b554-8f8f23477ccf","comment_uuid":"3b587313-4b16-4332-a384-f8dd0703ec57","author":"tLiK","content":"Fixed in the entry.rs commit above. Overrun bound changed from whole-file blob_end to min(rom_origin + rom_size, blob_end), mirroring upstream file.py:297 ROM-window semantics. Pin live; corpus roundtrip 54 + differential 53 green; single-ROM images unaffected (rom_origin+rom_size == blob_end there).","created_at":"2026-07-12T10:36:23.151877367Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAFr9KqXObjXmFHFTuf1ATIG8K/3WWWYp2KWeWnFofeSsbXML0N7S37v4XHGe4FsB+PFP68PHwMkanvy4pMZXcBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK65q21lDNDKx/Oyza7BI70uolT16+0yrvkg9/+bL3mtKq6EmtnjnWA1cZ78Uct/X+sIGJ0b4GEU3EzADvHe/A0="}
{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":251,"timestamp":"2026-07-12T11:06:45.713043156Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"ff92bee9-e6df-4936-9845-a74200067d0b","comment_uuid":"9a3bf510-e6e6-4f7b-ba6c-ed2bae063f0d","author":"tLiK","content":"PINNED. Failing tests at crates/psptool-core/tests/divergence_subparser_parseerror.rs demonstrate the divergence.\n\nConcrete byte condition (synthetic PSP dir, one header-type entry 0x01, body >= 0x100):\n- both_sha_bits: body[0x5b]=0b11 sets both sha256+sha384 checksum bits of the big-endian bitfield (header[0x58:0x5c]). Upstream header_file.py:63-64 raises File.ParseError; from_entry (file.py:270-272) returns None; directory.py:150-153 does not append -> ENTRY DROPPED.\n- undocumented_signed: body[0x30:0x34]=0x2 (not in {0,1,0xffff0000}). Upstream is_signed getter (header_file.py:126-128), evaluated during _parse at header_file.py:77, raises File.ParseError -> same drop.\n\nRust classify (entry.rs:639-643) calls HeaderEntry::parse().map(Header).unwrap_or(Plain); HeaderEntry::parse (entry.rs:164) does not implement either semantic check, so it returns Ok and Entry::parse_psp returns Ok(class=Header) -- the entry SURVIVES where upstream drops it. Confirmed: both tests FAIL under --ignored (Rust returns Ok(Header)); a well-formed-header control passes. Tests #[ignore]'d pending fix per R-DEFER-3.","created_at":"2026-07-12T11:06:45.708319159Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAzHIa8boAhCSoJpriB5x5L9PZJJz+Vl8/0Bkm3avwvI+9q3zkvMdCgaEp+6VLSGrG6JVLvqV3kbRbYodsWNwWBQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPy