{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":263,"timestamp":"2026-10-17T10:39:00.611338334Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"4d536e81-d60a-4bf5-a28b-bc08efab07f9","title":"decode-verified tiered bit: decode_verified()/decode_verification()/plaintext_identity_ok() + ls_json fields (PSPTool cutover stage-a)","description":"Port upstream PSPTool@13374bd1 HeaderFile._verify_decode ladder to psptool-rs. Adds tiered (bool,basis) decode-verification in psptool-ops layered on existing pubkey-map + core checksum/decompress helpers; mirrors plaintext_identity_ok() = (!encrypted || decode_verified()) && (method!='decompress-failed'). Surfaces decodeVerified/decodeVerificationMethod in ls --json and wires verify into ls File-Info (closes #76). Acceptance: exact corpus breakdown of 4147 HeaderFiles -> True 3159 (signature 3117 + plain 42), False 988 (signature-partial 295, signature-unresolved 251, signature-failed 376, unverifiable 66); live differential vs Python oracle stays 54/54; full gauntlet green. This is the parity contract downstream consumers (psp-etl #384, psp-db #388) key sha256_plain on. Board refs #385 #393. Implementation delegated to acto-builder.","priority":"high","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGkRqHRVFt6njsvEQahrrsS5OPxNM5uvXV6fcJpSDoq/QOCH1OpSGWIGVTaWq87Bc+fxFfaI0wbycI89vVXzLAU="}
{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":264,"timestamp":"2026-10-18T22:10:49.772939619Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4d536e81-d60a-4bf5-a28b-bc08efab07f9","comment_uuid":"f4dd211f-bece-41f5-8e53-0d9371979a95","author":"tLiK","content":"Plan (acto-builder): upstream = vringar/PSPTool@241629b (13374bd1 not fetchable from PSPReverse or vringar remotes; 241629b = master edae097 + the decode-verified commit). Placement: ladder lives in psptool-core body.rs as HeaderFile methods (upstream header_file.py:191-276 is a HeaderFile method; body.rs route lists header_file.py+cert_tree.py). psptool-ops verify.rs/lib.rs have no translate-route (hook-blocked), so ops wiring is in list.rs. Abstractions: core body.rs CertifyingKeys (cert_tree.py:255-406 pubkeys-by-id incl. KeyStoreFile $KDB keys key_store_file.py:140-253 — the missing key source behind 129 corpus 'signature-unresolved' diffs), SignatureCheck (is_verified), ChecksumCheck (verify_sha256/384), DecodeBasis (14 upstream labels + Rust-only decode-error where upstream raises), DecodeVerification {decode_verified, method, plaintext_identity_ok, signature, checksum}, Entry::decode_verification(blob, keys, ikek). Consumers: ops list.rs builds CertifyingKeys blob-wide (all ROMs, as CertificateTree.from_blob) -> JSON decodeVerified/decodeVerificationMethod for HeaderFile/KeyStoreFile entries (psptool.py:267-271) + File-Info tags verified/veri-failed/key_missing/invalid_sig + sha256_ok/_inconsistent (psptool.py:116-140, closes #76). Tests: ops integration tests (synthetic ladder rungs + corpus per-basis tally). Oracle run of 241629b over vendor corpus reproduces 4147 -> True 3159 / False 988 exactly.","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:10:49.668699051Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAWSLES48ftLKo9/Xcb0Hw56N