{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":271,"timestamp":"2026-10-18T22:43:18.864395310Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"65fd6a04-2f39-4bd1-be64-6d615daffd86","title":"Divergence: verify subcommand key map is PubkeyFile-only first-writer-wins; misses $KDB key-store keys upstream's CertificateTree uses (cert_tree.py:368-383)","description":"Spillover from #89. psptool-ops verify.rs verify_with_directories/collect_pubkeys builds HashMap<KeyId, PubkeyEntry> from PubkeyFile entries only, first-writer-wins, per ROM. Upstream's tree holds every key per id (any verifies -> verified), includes every KeyStoreFile $KDB key, and spans all ROMs of the blob. On the corpus the KDB keys alone move 129 HeaderFiles from unresolved to signature/signature-failed (AORUS_X570_X57AOXT2, ASRock-A520M-HSV). psptool_core::body::CertifyingKeys::from_blob (#89) is the faithful map; verify.rs should reuse it. Blocked on routing: crates/psptool-ops/src/verify.rs and lib.rs have no tooling/translate-routes.toml entry, so the translate-discipline hook blocks edits to them.","priority":"high","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOta2GKpla7VGTHZqSZA37DcRHt5QPatj3c8spLYIQRPHUgHd5l83gEaBOJY4IWA0+O9FUrx538HrHw0w2ImmQc="}
