{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":412,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T03:45:26.284487292Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"7a4a2989-01cd-495a-b276-b9d163275fa5","title":"Divergence: psptool-py extracts BIOS entry destination as i64 - OverflowError for destination >= 2**63 in repr(), get_readable_destination_address(), ls(), ls_json() (entry.py:140, file.py:366,413)","description":"Upstream destinations are Python ints (PSPTool 241629b):\n  entry.py:139-140  return super().__repr__()[:-1] + f', {self.destination=:#x})'\n  file.py:365-366   def get_readable_destination_address(self): return hex(self.entry.destination)\n  file.py:412-413   (BiosFile) return hex(self.destination)\n  used by psptool.py:149-158 (ls: BIOS + APOB File Info) and psptool.py:257-258 (ls_json destinationAddress).\npsptool-py extracts the u64 through i64: crates/psptool-py/src/directory.rs:447 'let destination: i64 = slf.getattr(\"destination\")?.extract()?;', file.rs:190 (File.get_readable_destination_address), file.rs:302 (BiosFile.__repr__), file.rs:311 (BiosFile.get_readable_destination_address via py_hex(i64), buffer.rs:528), file.rs:1418 (MicrocodeFile.__repr__).\nCorpus: 2523 BiosDirectoryEntry records of the 54-ROM corpus carry destination 0xffffffffffffffff (types 0x5, 0x7, 0x60, 0x63-0x68, 0x6a, 0x70): repr(entry) raises OverflowError; get_readable_destination_address() raises for 954 BiosFile, 1096 HeaderFile, 404 MicrocodeFile, 69 PubkeyFile; repr() of those BiosFile/MicrocodeFile raises. Reference renders '0xffffffffffffffff'.\nListing: with the first 0x62 BIOS entry's destination set to 0xffffffffffffffff (ASRock-A520M-HSV-1.31.ROM), upstream ls() prints destination(0xffffffffffffffff) and ls_json() emits destinationAddress '0xffffffffffffffff'; the bindings raise OverflowError from both (ls() also for a 0x61 APOB entry).\nFailing tests: crates/psptool-py/tests/divergence.rs::destination_renders_as_unsigned_hex (H12SSW9.719) and ::destination_listing_survives_u64_max (ASRock-A520M-HSV-1.31.ROM).","priority":"medium","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHJJNx302BqiSEidUxLYnmSVFNwyfDqyNklOZgKB4gNcUJ5LX6XD+OENK/6cxYE2U4FfmkGirQUv5KjM6/jwfAc="}
