{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":424,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T03:48:26.563107750Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"eb58e44e-7512-406d-bd87-16a7b1550424","title":"Divergence: psptool -E / -E -j list only ROM 0 of a multi-ROM blob; upstream ls()/ls_json() list every ROM (psptool.py:67-68, :205)","description":"Upstream PSPTool 241629b __main__.py:267 / :275 call psp.ls_json() / psp.ls(), which iterate every ROM regardless of -r (psptool.py:67-68 'for rom_index, rom in enumerate(self.blob.roms)', psptool.py:205 'for rom in self.blob.roms').\npsptool-cli's -E honours --rom-index (default 0, crates/psptool-cli/src/cli.rs:56-57) and lists a single ROM; crates/psptool-cli/tests/differential.rs:286-316 (collect_ours) iterates -r 0..8 and merges, which masks the difference.\nLive oracle, ASUS_PRIME-X470-PRO-ASUS-4804.CAP: reference -E -j lists 13 directories (ROM 1: 0x10b3000, 0x11fb000, 0x11b3000, 0x139b000; Generation 'Zen 2 (PSP ID 0xbc0b0500)' / None in -E), ours lists 10 (ROM 0 plus its combo); reference -E prints 2 ROM tables, ours 1. Same on ASUS_ROG-STRIX-X470-F-GAMING-ASUS-4804.CAP and H12SSW9.719: 12 upstream directories (and their Generation cells) absent from the default listing.\nFound while checking the list.rs vs model.rs zen_generation labels: where both tools list a directory the Generation text agrees (430 vs 411 directories over the corpus; remaining deltas are #122 None-vs-empty and the documented combo rows).\nFailing test: crates/psptool-cli/tests/divergence_multi_rom.rs.","priority":"medium","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOxPNVO6gU8tLKbvdR8TFveJGLLvbI3qbNi2oDrSVJrdGxzEvXXxD6x5yHN/fAKpIkHeN9GTGkZbBagu+7SYdQw="}
