{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":454,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T05:40:34.181423646Z","event":{"type":"IssueCreated","uuid":"c819ae29-5ece-4f69-be3b-a3d4b945cf46","title":"Divergence: ls Magic/ID and File Version cells of a HeaderFile differ in format from upstream (Milan ABL0 ours 00000000 / 00.00.00.00, upstream '' / 0.0.0.0)","description":"Spotted while fixing #115 on Milan KRPA-U16 0.13.0.50 (f84f3e9e). Upstream HeaderFile.get_readable_version is '.'.join(hex(b)[2:].upper() for b in header[0x63:0x5f:-1]) (header_file.py:56, :137-138): no zero padding, upper-case, e.g. PSP_FW_BOOT_LOADER '0.13.0.50' where psptool-ops list.rs version_string prints '00.13.00.50'. get_readable_magic (header_file.py:146-163) decodes the magic as ASCII and drops unprintable characters, so an all-zero magic is '' where list.rs magic_id_string prints '00000000'. list.md REQ-6 classifies these cells as self-oracle (differential-tolerated JSON keys), but the ls text cells are user-facing (R-DEV-2). Fix shape: port both upstream formatters in list.rs (text + JSON magic/version), regenerate list_micro + psptool-cli synthetic snapshots, add a live-reference corpus pin like divergence_list_text_headerfile_cells.rs. Changes ls output.","priority":"low","parent_uuid":"525d7258-de71-4087-8d5a-f7dd155266b5","created_by":"tLiK"},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOeVyUrbOu4AXRALP2mBi9U3/tMZN7604rAC2pePgzfkcsEr8hCWBl4BprwysKB4+hSrxVpVvVloIPyKxFYz4wE="}
