{"agent_id":"tLiK","agent_seq":472,"timestamp":"2026-10-25T19:33:07.160681061Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"8bbb17c6-b249-4f50-8024-921d9d8ea90d","comment_uuid":"6b000702-10ee-4df8-ac5e-39749da4915d","author":"tLiK","content":"Fixer attempt reverted (no change landed). A strict cap at size_uncompressed in zlib_decompress_strict cannot land within body.rs. (1) Reject past the cap (BodyError::Zlib): the pin still fails, because decode() maps Zlib errors to upstream's fallback Ok((compressed_region,false)) (header_file.py:201-204), so decode_best_effort returns the 65199-byte compressed region, which is more than 0x1000. It also regresses body::tests::get_decompressed_body_preserves_pre_zlib_prefix and divergence_body_bounds::{get_decompressed_body_zlib_size_is_absolute_offset_not_length, get_decompressed_body_no_prefix_control_passes}. (2) Truncate at the cap: the pin passes, but the same 3 core tests regress, plus psptool-ops decode_verification::{compressed_body_signature_is_over_the_inflated_bytes, truncated_zlib_stream_is_decompress_failed}; truncation also hides truncated streams. Root cause: upstream never reads size_uncompressed when inflating a HeaderFile (utils.py:241-254, header_file.py:201); only KeyStoreFile cuts by it (key_store_file.py:40). Upstream-oracle fixtures that leave it at 0 (or smaller than the payload) are therefore valid and pinned. Orchestrator decision needed on the bound (absolute or ratio cap vs size_uncompressed), on reject vs truncate, and on whether the pin's assertion should accept the decompress-failed fallback.","created_at":"2026-10-25T19:33:06.807797518Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAOc6aEdFN0lSE95yEt9KKtf1aMeKsZRfAx/it3yXR3ePvO9IqSY+2F8sh6QcHdZoqQBJeszl4np8dQQf9l5ejDg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:pi2rgM6dRaTX7StyiUVj9BegTQChW341Fra5MXz4iKc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgOi3VkKr4Jd4JgqerRa/w7ChR2ooa2tu6OIM/yho/EaUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNVdzOJxOeWKorOcbU803KmHda1fTTvp0THWK6rHnS5OmlYpk/NrsqqkCHBX1IGY09Kjx9q6lb8zQ5lFhJFYKg8="}
